  "title": "Chicken Cordon Bleu Bites",
  "description": "Appetizer-size ham and chicken meatballs have the surprise of melted Swiss cheese tucked inside. Easy to make, these tasty chicken Bordon Bleu bites are coated in bread crumbs, then deep-fried and baked.",
  "authors": [
    "LFARAONE"
  ],
